OL,3,GNEWSATravellers set to be told to move
OL,4,Afrom site
OL,5,
OL,6,FTravellers who moved onto a site near a
OL,7,Fnuclear weapons facility are likely to
OL,8,Fbe told to leave within weeks, a High
OL,9,FCourt judge said.
OL,11,FWest Berkshire Council first told
OL,12,Fpeople using the site south of Reading
OL,13,FRoad, opposite the Atomic Weapons
OL,14,FEstablishment (AWE), to stop work in
OL,15,FNovember 2025, following development
OL,16,Fearlier that year.
OL,18,FAWE said the arrivals were potentially
OL,19,Faffecting its work and the council was
OL,20,Fgranted an interim injunction to stop
OL,21,Ffurther development at the site in
OL,22,FDecember 2025.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
