OL,3,GNEWSATravellers set to be told to move
OL,4,Afrom site
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudge Sylvia de Bertodano said she had
OL,7,Fsympathy with the families affected but
OL,8,Fthey could not be allowed to "ride
OL,9,Froughshod" over the court's previous
OL,10,Forder.
